        {
          "rowNumber": 10,
          "cellList": [
            "Narration",
            "",
            "很久很久以前，在遥远的未来，\n天空的彼端，\n有着一位魔法少女们的女神。",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "Disp",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            ""
          ],
          "isHeader": false,
          "isComment": false,
          "isBlank": false
        },
        {
          "rowNumber": 11,
          "cellList": [
            "Narration",
            "",
            "女神每天都坐在宇宙的角落，\n听着不断旋转的\n无数唱片发出的音乐，\n露出安稳的微笑。",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            ""
          ],
          "isHeader": false,
          "isComment": false,
          "isBlank": false
        },
        {
          "rowNumber": 12,
          "cellList": [
            "Narration",
            "",
            "不管是远古时代，宇宙诞生时的胎动声响；\n或是遥远未来时，少女们欢笑的声音，\n女神一直都在旁守候着魔法少女们。",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            ""
          ],
          "isHeader": false,
          "isComment": false,
          "isBlank": false
        },
        {
          "rowNumber": 13,
          "cellList": [
            "Narration",
            "",
            "祂「一视同仁地」，\n倾听着这一切。",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            ""
          ],
          "isHeader": false,
          "isComment": false,
          "isBlank": false
        },
        {
          "rowNumber": 14,
          "cellList": [
